<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><strong>We're here to help</strong></p>

<p>I was sorry to hear that the delay meant you missed your &lt;meeting/dinner/concert/planned accommodation/train&gt;.</p>

<p>While we can't provide compensation on this occasion, if you had any unexpected expenses because of the &lt;delay/cancellation&gt;, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.</p>

<p>Please let us know if you'd like us to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claim.</p>

<p><strong>If offering a goodwill gesture due to Frequent Flyer tier:</strong></p>

<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I've credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity_c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.</p>

<p><strong>If not a Frequent Flyer:</strong></p>

<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I'd like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity_c}}} Qantas Points to you.</p>

<p>Please let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit the points to your account. If you're not already a member, you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a> to join free of charge.</p>

<p><strong>We value your opinion</strong></p>

<p>Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.</p>

<p>Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>